{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>On the desolate edge of the quasi-galaxy Clauson, a planet called KX27 was once an oasis of life until a ravenous war spanning millennia dragged it into the abyss.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You are Strawberry No. 14, a clone who suddenly woke up from the seaside. You have no memory, no past, only the superpowers engraved in your genes and the instinctive desire to survive.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/extras/14Weapon.gif?t=1746159764\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No. 14 can use his alienation ability to change the shape of his body and form different weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/extras/14Fusion.gif?t=1746159764\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No. 14 may also learn the monster's skills by absorbing the monster's corpse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The whole world seems to be hostile to No. 14. Can the lonely No. 14 survive in the harsh environment by using his own abilities and find a way to escape or uncover the truth of the whole thing? ?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706860?t=1746159764","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/ab9c9561139f78002cd3548cdd7fe428173ee16b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746159764","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/24190510b985444957d1c8376194033b59d0ada1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746159764","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706860/24190510b985444957d1c8376194033b59d0ada1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746159764","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descripti